WEBVTT

00:10:27.942 --> 00:10:31.295
Prosim vas, stojte z nami,

00:10:31.295 --> 00:10:35.110
ko ustvarjamo prihodnost brez nasilja

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:39.530
za ženske in dekleta 
in moške in fante vsepovsod.

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:41.692
Najlepša hvala.

00:10:41.692 --> 00:10:47.803
(Aplavz)